WEBVTT

01:29.980 --> 01:34.550
Episode 24
The Duke, Alice, and the Curse Witch

01:33.340 --> 01:34.940
Okay, Ms. Ichi!

01:36.960 --> 01:38.700
Please train me!

01:39.230 --> 01:42.140
I want to get stronger and protect everyone!

01:42.570 --> 01:43.660
Gimme a light.

01:45.430 --> 01:47.540
And you shouldn't smoke so much.

01:49.050 --> 01:50.600
About 800 degrees, I'd say.

01:50.600 --> 01:52.250
Not hot enough.

01:53.930 --> 01:56.130
You can get hotter, right?

01:56.380 --> 01:57.700
I want to get hotter!

01:57.700 --> 02:00.590
I want to make flames as hot as the sun!

02:00.850 --> 02:03.510
Okay, for today's training, no using fire.

02:03.510 --> 02:04.470
Why?

02:07.110 --> 02:08.000
What's this?

02:08.000 --> 02:10.960
Right now, your fire wouldn't even help you.

02:11.280 --> 02:14.020
First, defeat it without any magic.

02:17.130 --> 02:18.980
You're quite the athlete.

02:20.070 --> 02:22.160
Come see me at the circus sometime!

02:44.880 --> 02:49.230
<i>This is good exercise, but it's 
not helping me with my magic.</i>

02:49.780 --> 02:55.040
<i>I'll do what she wants, but I don't 
understand the point of this training.</i>

02:56.880 --> 02:59.240
<i>You think too much.</i>

03:00.010 --> 03:01.660
<i>Zain said the same thing.</i>

03:01.660 --> 03:03.320
<i>You look like you're not 
thinking about anything,</i>

03:03.320 --> 03:05.760
<i>but in your own empty-headed way, 
you're always thinking about others.</i>

03:06.120 --> 03:09.510
<i>Your kindness and caring are commendable.</i>

03:09.510 --> 03:12.920
<i>But in combat, they'll cost your life.</i>

03:13.820 --> 03:16.680
<i>When you're fighting, 
don't think about anything else.</i>

03:16.680 --> 03:19.150
<i>Not your friends. Not your opponent.</i>

03:19.150 --> 03:21.280
<i>Not even whether you're going to win or lose.</i>

03:21.880 --> 03:22.890
<i>Empty your mind.</i>

03:24.270 --> 03:26.810
<i>Focus on your battle.</i>

03:27.610 --> 03:31.690
<i>And then you'll become hotter 
than anything else in the world.</i>

03:39.170 --> 03:42.880
<i>But it'll take you a little 
longer to realize that, I think.</i>

03:43.800 --> 03:47.330
Training your mind will 
strengthen your magic as well.

03:52.040 --> 03:53.590
And I've got high hopes for you.

03:59.000 --> 04:01.010
Good morning, everyone.

04:01.540 --> 04:04.170
I'm your instructor, Flea.

04:04.510 --> 04:06.970
This is a wizardry school, but I'm a witch.

04:06.970 --> 04:09.010
What's that pose?

04:09.010 --> 04:11.280
A technique that allows me to look 
almost identical to Brother Nico

04:11.280 --> 04:12.230
by hiding everything but my eyes.

04:13.290 --> 04:14.480
<i>Please lose weight.</i>

04:15.430 --> 04:18.680
I will be teaching you 
what's in your textbooks.

04:18.680 --> 04:20.660
Please take notes.

04:20.970 --> 04:23.370
Can't we just memorize them?

04:23.370 --> 04:28.200
Why can't you just teach me how to control 
my time magic instead or something?

04:28.880 --> 04:31.800
If you pay attention in class, 
you'll learn that on your own eventually.

04:32.250 --> 04:35.150
I won't let you say <i>no</i> to taking <i>notes</i>!

04:35.820 --> 04:37.950
Those awful jokes...

04:37.950 --> 04:40.380
You really are trying to be like him.

04:41.290 --> 04:43.590
Now, let's begin class.

04:56.160 --> 04:58.560
A pop quiz for our young Death Incarnate!

04:58.560 --> 05:00.230
Huh? Me?

05:00.230 --> 05:04.600
Which of the following people summoned and 
made a contract with the devil Mephisto?

05:04.600 --> 05:06.380
A. A dog from my neighborhood.

05:06.380 --> 05:07.690
B. Brother Nico.

05:07.690 --> 05:09.030
C. Faust.

05:09.030 --> 05:10.740
Um...

05:11.300 --> 05:13.700
If you've been listening to 
the lecture, this should be easy.

05:14.860 --> 05:16.170
C-C?

05:16.400 --> 05:18.180
That's right!

05:18.180 --> 05:19.880
Wonderful! You're a genius!

05:20.170 --> 05:22.700
Thanks, Alice. You saved me!

05:23.420 --> 05:25.840
I always wanted to do something like this.

05:29.820 --> 05:32.560
That's all for my lesson today.

05:34.760 --> 05:37.860
Sister Ichi will be your 
instructor for second period.

05:37.860 --> 05:40.020
Go to her classroom.

05:41.400 --> 05:43.330
My shoulders are so stiff!

05:43.330 --> 05:46.650
I can't believe he's teaching us all 
this really basic stuff about magic.

05:46.650 --> 05:47.230
Zain.

05:47.230 --> 05:48.490
What?

05:48.930 --> 05:55.020
Can your time magic heal, say, 
scars on somebody's face?

05:55.350 --> 05:57.370
Make it so they never happened?

05:57.370 --> 05:59.960
I can't say for sure, but maybe.

06:01.130 --> 06:01.960
I see.

06:08.030 --> 06:09.850
Your sneeze is so cute, Daleth.

06:09.850 --> 06:11.890
Quiet.

06:13.030 --> 06:15.190
I'm sure Cuff already knows this,

06:15.190 --> 06:18.750
but I teach through actual combat,
 and I'm a tough teacher.

06:18.750 --> 06:23.690
My goal is for you to learn how to operate 
magical items in combat instinctively.

06:23.690 --> 06:25.320
Magical items?

06:25.320 --> 06:27.290
How do we use them?

06:27.290 --> 06:30.370
The point of this class is 
for you to figure that out.

06:30.370 --> 06:31.820
You're not going to tell us?

06:31.820 --> 06:34.560
If you can't figure it out, you'll die.

06:34.560 --> 06:36.220
Now, figure out a way to use your item.

06:36.220 --> 06:38.290
As soon as you've done that, 
you're free to go on break.

06:39.540 --> 06:41.750
I've got it! I can use 
it for something naughty!

06:42.420 --> 06:43.960
No, moron!

06:44.490 --> 06:46.170
Then I'll... throw it!

06:46.690 --> 06:47.610
No!

06:47.930 --> 06:49.710
Don't let go of your weapon!

06:49.710 --> 06:51.760
Ooh, I did get something naughty!

06:52.090 --> 06:53.460
Don't sound so happy!

06:53.930 --> 06:55.600
I can't figure it out!

06:55.600 --> 06:57.470
Do I push it? Pull it? Twist it?

06:58.730 --> 07:00.930
I think I could use it as a hair ornament.

07:00.930 --> 07:03.360
Even at a time like this, you're cute!

07:03.830 --> 07:06.930
All right, time for the lesson to begin!

07:10.870 --> 07:12.410
Alice, watch out!

07:15.060 --> 07:16.000
Your Grace...

07:16.000 --> 07:18.350
Just hide under me!

07:20.610 --> 07:22.180
N-No! No!

07:22.180 --> 07:24.700
I'm not thinking of anything weird!

07:24.700 --> 07:26.540
I haven't said a word yet.

07:26.540 --> 07:28.440
You there! Stop flirting!

07:28.980 --> 07:30.680
Figure it out already!

07:30.680 --> 07:33.980
If I was Sade, you'd be dead
 30 times over by now!

07:33.980 --> 07:35.780
But I don't understand!

07:42.890 --> 07:44.300
One of you figured it out.

07:44.300 --> 07:45.380
Wow! Wow!

07:45.380 --> 07:46.700
How'd you do it?

07:46.700 --> 07:49.630
It reminded me of the hilt of my rapier...

07:47.590 --> 07:50.690
<b>The Face of a Man Who's Not
 100% Sure What He Just Did</b>

07:49.630 --> 07:50.690
So I tried thrusting with it.

07:50.690 --> 07:53.370
That's right. It's a hilt.

07:53.370 --> 07:54.730
When you make a thrusting motion with it,

07:54.730 --> 07:57.410
the magic inside will activate 
and turn it into a sword.

07:58.150 --> 08:00.190
Master it, and it becomes a powerful weapon.

08:00.560 --> 08:03.130
<i>All the things mother made me do every day...</i>

08:03.440 --> 08:06.150
<i>I'm so glad I did them!</i>

08:06.150 --> 08:06.970
I'll give you a reward, too.

08:06.970 --> 08:09.210
You can have it, second son.

08:11.890 --> 08:14.220
They're all working hard.

08:14.220 --> 08:17.550
If they keep this up, we'll be 
able to strengthen our forces.

08:21.030 --> 08:23.770
<i>Was that...</i>

08:26.360 --> 08:27.870
Sade?

08:41.180 --> 08:45.400
<i>We finally made it inside... 
so where did Keto go?</i>

08:47.910 --> 08:49.920
<i>Wizardry books. How worthless.</i>

08:50.780 --> 08:53.740
<i>Human magic is all just copied from ours.</i>

08:54.880 --> 08:56.210
Is this...

08:56.210 --> 08:57.740
Who are you?

08:58.600 --> 09:00.810
What a strange boy. Do you want something?

09:00.810 --> 09:03.310
Did you come back to life, Sade?

09:03.310 --> 09:05.450
<i>He knows Sade?</i>

09:05.830 --> 09:08.450
<i>He's a wizard, from the look of his magic.</i>

09:09.890 --> 09:12.590
<i>Maybe I'll have him tell me a little more.</i>

09:12.590 --> 09:13.240
That's right.

09:13.240 --> 09:14.960
I am Sade!

09:14.960 --> 09:17.640
I've come crawling back 
here from the pits of hell.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.610
<i>He can control space...</i>

09:22.270 --> 09:25.830
Damn you, Sade!

09:26.250 --> 09:28.580
You killed so many of my friends...

09:28.940 --> 09:31.400
I'll kill you again!

09:33.770 --> 09:36.470
<i>His magic is a copy of ours, but it's strong.</i>

09:38.410 --> 09:39.790
Illusion magic?

09:47.100 --> 09:48.440
What are you doing?

09:48.440 --> 09:49.770
It makes you mad, doesn't it?

09:50.090 --> 09:52.770
What do you mean, "kill me again"?

09:52.770 --> 09:54.990
Did you lose your memories 
when you went to hell?

09:55.220 --> 09:58.700
You died over a decade ago! We killed you!

10:00.980 --> 10:06.080
But I can't break the immortality 
curse you put on me.

10:06.080 --> 10:09.110
I can't even age alongside the woman I love!

10:09.600 --> 10:12.130
I'll rip this illusion apart!

10:13.020 --> 10:15.070
This is my school.

10:15.070 --> 10:16.440
And I'm in charge here.

10:18.560 --> 10:20.970
<i>She made her enemy immortal?</i>

10:20.970 --> 10:23.530
<i>What was Sade thinking?</i>

10:24.490 --> 10:26.340
I have better things to do than fight you.

10:26.340 --> 10:27.690
Sleep.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.450
No...

10:33.900 --> 10:37.610
I c-can't let this illusion beat me...

10:39.190 --> 10:40.580
Snap out of it!

10:40.580 --> 10:41.360
Ichi!

10:41.360 --> 10:42.630
I'll help you.

10:42.630 --> 10:45.240
No matter who they are, 
don't fall for their tricks.

10:46.240 --> 10:48.710
You can fight me!

10:49.290 --> 10:51.020
Now it's two on two!

10:51.020 --> 10:52.860
Where did you go?

10:52.860 --> 10:55.450
You're the one who disappeared on me!

10:55.450 --> 10:57.350
But since you picked a fight with our boss,

10:57.350 --> 10:59.460
now I'mma end you FR, FR.

10:59.460 --> 11:00.590
Use actual words.

11:01.560 --> 11:04.050
Is that really Sade?

11:04.510 --> 11:05.580
I don't know.

11:05.960 --> 11:09.610
But if we keep fighting any longer 
it will put the students in danger.

11:10.080 --> 11:11.980
Have Flea evacuate them all.

11:12.820 --> 11:13.730
Students?

11:16.140 --> 11:17.500
Daleth!

11:18.490 --> 11:20.490
I'm not Sade.

11:20.490 --> 11:21.860
You're saying that now?

11:23.870 --> 11:29.080
I can't believe this school was made 
by the people who defeated Sade.

11:29.710 --> 11:30.690
Yes.

11:30.690 --> 11:33.040
I just came to follow Walter.

11:33.990 --> 11:38.140
On that day, Sade vanished without a word...

11:38.530 --> 11:40.640
And she never came back.

11:41.070 --> 11:42.300
I don't know how I feel about this.

11:42.980 --> 11:44.840
That's right.

11:44.840 --> 11:47.930
I'm happy I get this cute uniform, though.

11:49.010 --> 11:52.190
It's just cloth.

11:55.930 --> 11:58.140
I was on the fence about this,

11:58.570 --> 12:02.610
but we've got two new students 
who've asked to join our class.

12:02.610 --> 12:06.210
They say they know you all already, though.

12:07.610 --> 12:08.910
Viola, yay!

12:08.910 --> 12:10.610
Keto, yay!

12:10.610 --> 12:12.440
These uniforms are great!

12:12.440 --> 12:13.380
Totally!

12:13.380 --> 12:15.470
That's why I came here!

12:15.470 --> 12:17.380
How do you know each other?

12:18.970 --> 12:19.930
I look weird.

12:19.930 --> 12:21.090
I look so weird.

12:21.090 --> 12:23.340
I look like I'm pretending 
to be younger than I am.

12:23.340 --> 12:26.470
I'm over 150 years old! And I'm 
wearing this indecent outfit...

12:26.470 --> 12:28.060
You okay?

12:29.970 --> 12:32.200
Now, let's start class.

12:32.200 --> 12:35.440
I'm in charge of teaching you about Sade.

12:35.880 --> 12:41.440
Teaching you about her will 
help to break our curses.

12:42.290 --> 12:45.230
Let's start with Daleth. Since you're here,

12:45.230 --> 12:48.350
is there anything you can 
say, as her younger sister?

12:50.250 --> 12:53.460
There's nothing I can tell you.

12:53.460 --> 12:54.880
Okay.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.280
Let me know if you change your mind.

12:56.280 --> 12:58.170
Or speak up if anything occurs to you.

12:58.770 --> 13:00.600
There's some things you 
wouldn't want to tell me,

13:00.600 --> 13:02.880
but you can tell your friends, I'm sure.

13:03.610 --> 13:05.770
<i>They're not my friends.</i>

13:07.270 --> 13:10.510
<i>And he'll be more than just a friend...</i>

13:12.560 --> 13:14.700
If it bothers you, wear this.

13:15.630 --> 13:17.270
Th-Thank you.

13:17.270 --> 13:21.730
Let's start with how we 
beat Sade the first time.

13:36.830 --> 13:38.350
This is a mess.

13:42.330 --> 13:44.430
Okay, everybody's here.

13:46.010 --> 13:47.410
Is it true, Zain?

13:47.410 --> 13:49.790
That you're going to try going 
back into the past tonight.

13:49.790 --> 13:50.690
Yeah.

13:50.690 --> 13:53.430
Meeting Sade directly will tell us a lot.

13:54.030 --> 13:57.770
And with this group, even if we get caught,
we probably won't be in too much trouble.

13:57.770 --> 13:59.570
Do I have to go, too?

13:59.570 --> 14:01.210
You're our guide.

14:01.210 --> 14:02.400
I need you to come.

14:05.480 --> 14:07.580
This is the door to the past?

14:07.580 --> 14:11.510
Coming here has definitely made 
it easier to control my magic.

14:11.510 --> 14:14.100
It still takes some time to set up, though.

14:14.100 --> 14:16.550
I was so busy today I didn't even 
try to sneak into the girls' bath!

14:16.550 --> 14:18.080
That's nothing to be proud of, right?

14:18.610 --> 14:20.490
Anyway, let's go.

14:20.490 --> 14:23.510
As I see it, Sade's probably 
got big tits, too.

14:24.100 --> 14:26.620
He has magical talent, but he's stupid.

14:26.620 --> 14:27.580
Daleth...

14:28.900 --> 14:30.490
There's something I want to ask you.

14:30.870 --> 14:36.290
Could Sade... read minds?

14:37.500 --> 14:40.760
There wasn't anything else in the 
logbook that could've mattered.

14:41.080 --> 14:44.610
That's what you wanted to hide so 
badly that you threatened Zain, right?

14:47.150 --> 14:48.350
I can't answer that.

14:48.960 --> 14:51.820
She still has me under her spell.

14:53.560 --> 14:55.290
That's why I want to be free of her.

14:55.920 --> 14:59.500
I'm only helping today for my own sake.

15:00.890 --> 15:02.400
Let's get going, too.

15:02.400 --> 15:03.840
Yes, Your Grace.

15:11.860 --> 15:13.600
This is our family's home.

15:13.600 --> 15:17.090
Yes. I lived here before I was cursed.

15:17.090 --> 15:19.830
It seems we were separated.

15:20.360 --> 15:23.240
If someone sees us, the future might change.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.230
Let's hide

15:25.860 --> 15:29.400
Did the rest of them make it here?

15:29.760 --> 15:31.250
Hey, Daleth.

15:31.250 --> 15:32.090
You okay?

15:32.640 --> 15:34.660
Do I look like Daleth to you?

15:36.970 --> 15:39.870
Yes, you're from the future!

15:40.890 --> 15:42.330
Sade.

15:46.260 --> 15:50.510
<i>Just like he guessed, Sade can read minds.</i>

15:51.590 --> 15:53.470
<i>They're both masters of the magical arts...</i>

15:53.690 --> 15:56.160
<i>How will Zain get out of this situation?</i>

15:56.160 --> 15:58.180
Wahoo! She does have big tits!

16:03.070 --> 16:05.150
Where did they go?

16:06.260 --> 16:10.260
It's dangerous to approach 
Sade before we find them.

16:10.260 --> 16:13.070
Even if we see her, let's 
just watch from afar.

16:13.070 --> 16:14.360
Yes, we'll just watch.

16:14.610 --> 16:17.530
I love it when you watch me, Your Grace.

16:17.530 --> 16:19.830
That was very cute, but...

16:20.080 --> 16:20.900
Aah!

16:27.690 --> 16:28.960
You're...

16:34.580 --> 16:36.140
Grandfather Victor?

16:36.140 --> 16:39.150
Do you have someone you love?

16:39.150 --> 16:39.790
Huh?

16:39.790 --> 16:41.070
<i>The first thing she wants 
to talk about is romance?</i>

16:41.070 --> 16:44.020
Love ain't my thing. I've never understood.

16:44.340 --> 16:46.350
<i>I'll make up an answer and run away.</i>

16:46.570 --> 16:49.230
I'm being very serious.

16:49.230 --> 16:52.320
Don't you think love is a wonderful thing?

16:52.320 --> 16:53.360
<i>She's scary!</i>

16:53.360 --> 16:54.950
<i>What's wrong with her eyes?</i>

16:54.950 --> 16:56.780
<i>She'd be pretty otherwise...</i>

16:57.530 --> 17:01.110
For the first time in my 
life, I have someone I love.

17:01.440 --> 17:03.300
But death is coming, soon!

17:03.770 --> 17:07.250
Do you know how much I love him?

17:07.250 --> 17:10.190
I wanted to be with him forever,

17:10.190 --> 17:11.870
but someone got in the way.

17:11.870 --> 17:15.720
Everyone got in the way! Everyone!

17:15.720 --> 17:17.600
Stop swaying like that! You're scaring me!

17:17.600 --> 17:20.170
I know! Let's talk about something more fun!

17:20.170 --> 17:23.680
Hey, how about something 
naughty? Maybe a dirty joke?

17:23.680 --> 17:25.330
You're in the way, too!

17:29.450 --> 17:30.760
An illusion...?

17:35.010 --> 17:36.200
Daleth...

17:38.730 --> 17:40.930
So she doesn't like dirty jokes?

17:40.930 --> 17:41.760
Thanks.

17:41.760 --> 17:43.120
Don't tell Cuff.

17:43.120 --> 17:45.350
Start making a time door, now.

17:45.350 --> 17:47.430
I'll distract Sade.

17:47.430 --> 17:48.670
S-Sure.

17:48.670 --> 17:49.900
Daleth...

17:49.900 --> 17:52.420
You were ugly, and I loved you anyway.

17:52.420 --> 17:55.380
But the future you doesn't love me?

17:56.330 --> 17:58.820
Your eyes are still full of 
fear, like they always were.

17:58.820 --> 18:00.330
I'll make you remember...

18:00.690 --> 18:03.020
That I'm the Queen.

18:04.810 --> 18:06.680
Grandfather?

18:06.680 --> 18:09.990
I don't have any grandchildren your age...

18:09.990 --> 18:11.810
Oh, um...

18:11.810 --> 18:12.590
What?

18:12.590 --> 18:15.430
Were you up to something naughty?

18:16.370 --> 18:19.610
I don't have anything 
worth stealing, you know.

18:19.610 --> 18:21.120
Except all that money.

18:21.120 --> 18:22.330
<i>A noble's joke!</i>

18:22.670 --> 18:26.560
You don't look like robbers to me, though.

18:26.560 --> 18:28.210
If you're lost as to what to do,

18:28.210 --> 18:31.160
make the choice you won't 
regret in the future.

18:31.160 --> 18:36.610
Yes. Grandfather, um... 
please be good to Sharon.

18:37.010 --> 18:39.590
Oh, you know Sharon?

18:39.590 --> 18:40.500
Shall I get her for you?

18:40.500 --> 18:41.420
Um...

18:41.420 --> 18:43.730
Thank you.

18:43.730 --> 18:46.350
But we'll be on our way.

18:47.750 --> 18:48.730
I see.

18:48.730 --> 18:51.230
Oh, there you are, master.

18:51.230 --> 18:53.180
The man with one eye!

18:53.180 --> 18:56.440
Wow, do I have a cool nickname like that?

18:58.050 --> 18:59.850
It was an honor to meet you.

19:00.420 --> 19:01.530
Farewell.

19:05.220 --> 19:06.410
Who were they?

19:06.410 --> 19:08.970
I don't know. I've never 
seen those children before.

19:08.970 --> 19:10.870
You and your whims...

19:11.370 --> 19:15.420
I didn't expect to run into Grandfather 
Victor. That surprised me.

19:15.420 --> 19:17.650
So that's what he's like.

19:17.650 --> 19:20.880
I know I must've seen him 
when I was little, but...

19:20.880 --> 19:23.300
I just barely remember him myself.

19:23.300 --> 19:24.880
But I liked him.

19:25.340 --> 19:26.790
I remember I started to wear

19:26.790 --> 19:30.140
this hat I found in the villa 
because I wanted to be like him.

19:32.850 --> 19:35.060
We're leaving! Sade found us!

19:38.150 --> 19:39.450
Why so sudden?

19:39.450 --> 19:41.240
I'll tell you later.

19:41.530 --> 19:43.280
Daleth, hurry up!

19:47.850 --> 19:49.390
Sade is close!

19:49.390 --> 19:50.990
Close the door, now!

19:50.990 --> 19:53.210
Can you say that again, in a cuter voice!

19:53.210 --> 19:54.920
I will break every bone in your body.

19:55.760 --> 19:56.930
Wait.

19:56.930 --> 19:59.050
Let me come, too!

19:59.050 --> 20:00.630
Stay away, Sade!

20:03.480 --> 20:06.010
Alice. Sharon's daughter...

20:06.010 --> 20:09.210
Disgusting girl.

20:20.460 --> 20:22.200
Well, that was close.

20:23.090 --> 20:24.870
That girl ain't normal.

20:24.870 --> 20:28.040
You sure you can be friends with her?

20:28.580 --> 20:33.670
Let's just pray that meeting 
her didn't affect the future.

20:35.790 --> 20:38.130
Though it doesn't seem 
to have, for the moment.

20:52.850 --> 20:56.100
<i>Will we really be able to 
talk things out with her?</i>

21:03.280 --> 21:05.200
<i>I can't let myself get down!</i>

21:08.530 --> 21:10.730
<i>I made my choice, right?</i>

21:12.510 --> 21:15.940
<i>I'm going to be friends with Sade.</i>

22:47.990 --> 22:49.480
You okay, Alice?

22:49.480 --> 22:51.900
You must've been scared back there.

22:51.900 --> 22:56.930
No, I'm not scared of anything 
as long as I'm with you.

22:58.360 --> 23:00.190
When spring... comes...

23:05.760 --> 23:07.500
No, never mind.

23:07.500 --> 23:08.690
Forget it.

23:10.320 --> 23:11.660
<i>When spring comes...</i>

23:12.300 --> 23:14.070
<i>I want to be able to hold your hand.</i>

23:15.530 --> 23:16.650
<i>And...</i>

23:32.810 --> 23:34.250
What a great nap!
